div.p:
Having regard to the Opinion of the European Parliament (
               1
            );

Having regard to the Opinion of the Economic and Social Committee (
               2
            );

Whereas this Regulation must apply to the relevant provisions of Regulation No 11 concerning the abolition of discrimination in transport rates and conditions, in implementation of Article 79 (3) of the Treaty (
               3
            ) establishing the European Economic Community, of Regulation No 17 (
               4
            ): first Regulation implementing Articles 85 and 86 of the Treaty, and of Council Regulation (EEC) No 1017/68 (
               5
            ) of 19 July 1968 applying rules of competition to transport by rail, road and inland waterway; whereas it must also apply to the relevant provisions of future regulations in the fields of European Economic Community law relating to transport and competition,

body.p:
This Regulation shall not apply to measures taken under Council Regulation (EC) No 1/2003 of 16 December 2002 on the implementation of the rules on competition laid down in Articles 81 and 82 of the Treaty (
            6
         ).
